{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794323600145,"sessionID":"ses_e3a15e872fferShHubfyy4fOxe","part":{"id":"prt_1c60552ef001YD6q28fHQVjiAi","messageID":"msg_1c60502e60014zwSE5TEeUK9Xn","sessionID":"ses_e3a15e872fferShHubfyy4fOxe","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794323600146,"sessionID":"ses_e3a15e872fferShHubfyy4fOxe","part":{"id":"prt_1c60552f2001qzA9NboPbTDOO0","messageID":"msg_1c60502e60014zwSE5TEeUK9Xn","sessionID":"ses_e3a15e872fferShHubfyy4fOxe","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a recipe book: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` + React (TypeScript, Vite) frontend with Tailwind CSS, SQLite storage in `./data`, served by one server on port 8000.\n- Anyone can browse recipes; signed-in users register/login (Bearer token auth) and add/edit/delete only their own recipes.\n\n## Important Details\n- API contract:\n  - `POST /api/auth/register` {username,password} → 201; `POST /api/auth/login` → 200 `{\"token\": \"...\"}`; auth via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 without valid token.\n  - `POST /api/recipes` (auth), `GET /api/recipes` (paged: `category`, `q`, `page`, `page_size`; newest first; no ingredients/instructions), `GET /api/recipes/{id}` (full), `PUT`/`DELETE` (author only).\n  - Recipe fields: `id`, `title`, `ingredients` (ordered list), `instructions` (line breaks preserved), `category`, `prep_minutes`, `servings`, `created_at`, `author`.\n  - List response: `{\"items\": [...], \"total\", \"page\", \"page_size\"}`; item fields: `id`, `title`, `category`, `prep_minutes`, `author`.\n  - `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`; unknown `/api/*` paths return JSON 404.\n- Seed on first start: 3–5 recipes across ≥2 categories (4 seeded: Breakfast/Soup/Dinner/Dessert under user \"Sample Kitchen\").\n- Stack/paths: entry `backend/app.py` (gunicorn `app:app`, `--pythonpath backend`), deps `backend/requirements.txt` + pinned `backend/requirements.lock` (hashes; update lock if deps change), Vite project `frontend/`, `npm run build` → `frontend/dist`. Dockerfile at workspace root copies `frontend/dist` next to backend; listens on 8000; persistent data in `./data` relative to `/app`.\n- Styling: Tailwind utility classes only (Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, entry `frontend/src/index.css` with `@import \"tailwindcss\";`).\n- Validation error format: `{\"error\": <message>, \"errors\": {field: msg}}` with 400; 409 duplicate username; 403 non-author edit/delete; 204 on delete.\n- Sandbox: no Docker available; verify with gunicorn directly. `/tmp/opencode` is root-owned — use `/workspace/.gunicorn.log` for logs. Extra npm deps installed: `react-router-dom@7.18.5`, `tailwindcss@4.3.5`, `@tailwindcss/vite`, `typescript`, `@types/react`, `@types/react-dom`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Deps installed (npm + pip flask/gunicorn); `frontend/package.json` updated, `package-lock.json` regenerated.\n- `backend/app.py` fully implemented: SQLite schema (users/tokens/recipes), seeding, auth (register/login, token table, werkzeug password hashing), recipe CRUD with validation, ordered ingredients (JSON list), `q`/`category` filters (case-insensitive), paging, `/api/categories`, frontend serving with SPA fallback, `/api/health`.\n- API smoke tests pass: 65/65 (`/workspace/.smoke.py` run against gunicorn on 127.0.0.1:8000).\n- Frontend config written: `frontend/vite.config.ts` (react + tailwind plugins, `/api` proxy), `frontend/tsconfig.json`, `frontend/src/index.css`, `frontend/src/types.ts`, `frontend/src/api.ts` (fetch wrapper, `ApiError`, localStorage token/username), `frontend/src/auth.tsx` (`AuthProvider`, `useAuth`).\n- `frontend/src/App.tsx` written (BrowserRouter, Header with sign-in/out + username, routes: `/`, `/recipes/new`, `/recipes/:id`, `/recipes/:id/edit`, `/signin`, `/register`, 404 page); stray misplaced import fixed.\n- `frontend/src/pages/RecipeList.tsx` written (cards with title/category/prep/author, category dropdown from `/api/categories`, title search, paging with page_size 9, URL search params).\n\n### Active\n- Writing remaining frontend pages: `RecipeDetail.tsx`, `RecipeForm.tsx`, `SignIn.tsx`, `Register.tsx` under `frontend/src/pages/`.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Create `frontend/src/pages/SignIn.tsx` and `frontend/src/pages/Register.tsx` (forms posting to `/api/auth/login|register`, showing `ApiError` messages, calling `signIn(token, username)`).\n2. Create `frontend/src/pages/RecipeDetail.tsx` (ingredients as `<ul>`, instructions with line breaks preserved e.g. `whitespace-pre-line`, author-only Edit/Delete with delete confirmation) and `frontend/src/pages/RecipeForm.tsx` (add + edit, ingredient rows add/remove, per-field validation messages from `ApiError.errors`).\n3. Run `npm run build` in `frontend/`, fix TS/build errors (update `frontend/package-lock.json` only if deps change), then integration-test via gunicorn and verify contract; delete temp files (`/workspace/.smoke.py`, `/workspace/.gunicorn.log`, `/workspace/.gunicorn.pid`) at the end.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + frontend serving (entry, `app:app`).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned pip deps (flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: root build (frontend build stage → Python image, gunicorn on 8000).\n- `/workspace/README.md`: run contract / layout notes.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `index.html`: Vite project config.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `auth.tsx`, `api.ts`, `types.ts`, `index.css`: app shell, auth context, API client, types, Tailwind entry.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/RecipeList.tsx`: done; `RecipeDetail.tsx`, `RecipeForm.tsx`, `SignIn.tsx`, `Register.tsx` still to write.\n- `/workspace/.smoke.py`: 65-test API smoke suite (rerunnable).\n- `/workspace/data/recipes.db`: SQLite DB (auto-created/seeded on first start).","time":{"start":1794323600114,"end":1794323600117}}}
